Package: linux-headers-5.10.0-0.deb11.2-arm64
Architecture: arm64
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel !pkg.linux.quick !stage1>
Depends: linux-headers-5.10.0-0.deb11.2-common (= ${source:Version}), linux-kbuild-5.10 (>= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, gcc-11
Description: Header files for Linux 5.10.0-0.deb11.2-arm64
 This package provides the architecture-specific kernel header files for
 Linux kernel 5.10.0-0.deb11.2-arm64, generally used for building
 out-of-tree kernel modules.  These files are going to be installed into
 /usr/src/linux-headers-5.10.0-0.deb11.2-arm64, and can be used for
 building modules that load into the kernel provided by the
 linux-image-5.10.0-0.deb11.2-arm64 package.

